  "description": "Goguryeo royal descendant Eulbul. He regains the throne from his family's enemy and is reborn as a true king! The story of a hero's growth as he drives out the enemies who have invaded Goguryeo for 400 years and reclaims Nakrang Commandery! Fierce strategies and tactics unfold. An epic war story where unparalleled heroes clash!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
